  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "🌴 Premier WaterColor Retreat – A Favorite Family Escape on 30A 🌴<br><br>Experience the best of WaterColor, the #1 family vacation destination on 30A, from this beautifully designed coastal home ideally located just a short golf cart ride from top resort amenities and community favorites.<br><br>Prime Location & Resort Amenities<br>-3 minute golf cart ride to Dragonfly Pool<br>-5 minute golf cart ride to WaterColor Beach Club, Camp WaterColor, The Boathouse, Frog Pool, and more<br>-Up to 12 WaterColor Amenity Bands included in the reservation quote<br>-Access to 9 resort style community pools, with one including a fun filled lazy river, all heated year round along with a beach side bar & chairs/umbrellas available for rent<br>-Poolside dining, ice cream shops, and convenience stores throughout the community<br><br>Transportation & Outdoor Fun Included<br>-2023 street legal 6 seat Ex Car golf cart<br>-4 beach bikes<br>-Full set of beach gear including chairs, beach tent, coolers, puddle jumpers, boogie boards, and beach toys<br><br>Family Friendly Features<br>-Pack n Play, high chair, car seats, and stroller, and all the children's games for indoor fun<br>-High speed Wi Fi and large TVs throughout the home<br><br>🏡 Welcome to Villa Bella – A Relaxed Luxury Coastal Escape<br><br>Relax and unwind in this spacious 4 bedroom, 4.5 bath luxury home, thoughtfully designed to accommodate up to 12 guests in comfort and style. Recently built and tastefully decorated with a coastal ambiance, this two story retreat offers a warm and inviting atmosphere for your beach getaway.<br><br>The open concept living area features cozy seating, a generous dining space, a fully equipped gourmet kitchen, and a bar area perfect for gathering. The kitchen includes stainless steel appliances, a Keurig coffee maker, Ninja blender, hand mixer, Air Fryer, and everything needed to prepare meals with ease. Step outside to two inviting patios with oversized porch bed swings, ideal for morning coffee or relaxing evenings after a day in the sun.<br><br>🛏️ Spacious & Flexible Sleeping Arrangements<br><br>-Three Master Suites with King Beds<br>-One downstairs with a 55 inch large TV and private ensuite bathroom<br>-Two upstairs, including one with access to a screened balcony featuring a twin bed swing and a 55 inch large TV<br>-Fourth Bedroom with two twin beds and pull out trundles with a large 55 inch TV<br>-Additional sleeping options at no extra charge include a full size pull out bed in the upstairs room <br><br>.All televisions include access to popular streaming services, and complimentary high speed Wi Fi is available throughout the home.<br><br>🌊 Everything You Need for a Carefree Stay<br><br>Villa Bella is fully equipped to help you travel light. Enjoy a full size washer and dryer, iron, ironing board, and laundry detergent. Beach chairs, umbrellas, coolers, puddle jumpers, and toys are provided for your convenience, and towel service is available upon arrival at the WaterColor Beach Club.<br><br>Whether you are spending the day at the beach, enjoying the pools, or exploring scenic 30A, Villa Bella offers the perfect blend of comfort, convenience, and relaxed coastal living.<br><br>*We are only able to accommodate wristbands for amenity access for the amount of people on your reservation. Unfortunately, we are unable to accommodate last minute changes to the amount of wristbands. Changes must be made at least 10 days prior to arrival. Thank you for your understanding.<br>***Wristbands are required at all Watercolor amenities for guests ages 5 and older. Please note that our HOA requires a 48 hour notice to supply amenity bands for reservations. We are unable to obtain wristbands without a 48 hour notice during M-F business hours.<br><br>House Rules:<br>No Smoking, No Parties, No Pets unless prior approval up to maximum of 2 (Dogs Only)<br><br>Minimum renter age is 25.<br><br>Guest must sign Renter Agreement and Golf Cart/Bike Waivers, provide a valid & current copy of all guests' 18+ U.S. Driver's License, provide a valid & current copy of Auto Insurance for all guests 25+, and names/ages of all guests on reservation within 24 hours of booking or reservation will be cancelled. Must be U.S. Citizen to book. Signer of agreements must have a valid U.S. Driver's License and valid U.S. Auto Insurance in their name.<br><br>Quiet Time is ENFORCED 10:00 PM through 8:00 AM<br><br>Security Deposit required of $350 and up to $500. Deposit to be processed by Host on guest's credit card unless already included during booking.<br><br>Additional Pet Fee required of $375.00-$450.00 per pet. Please specify if your pet is an ESA or SD. If you bring a pet you will be required to supply current pet vaccination records.<br><br>Amount of guests on reservation will be the amount of amenity wristbands you will receive for your stay. There will be no changes to the amount of wristbands - it is based on the amount of guests on the initial reservation.<br><br>CHECK-IN: You will receive an email 72 hours before check-in with check-in instructions. Our concierge will meet you on-site for check-in to complete a walk-through, and you will be required to complete the check-in form (please note that only the person whose name is on the reservation can complete the required check-in form). Our concierge will release the door code to the home upon your arrival. We will coordinate with you on the day of check-in for arrival times.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
